Ladybird uploads a LUMINANCE_ALPHA texture from an image or a canvas as
each pixel’s red and alpha channels, and a LUMINANCE texture as its red
channel, as the other engines do. Blink’s WebGLImageConversion packs
LUMINANCE_ALPHA as kDataFormatRA8 and LUMINANCE as kDataFormatR8, and
Gecko’s WebGLTexelConversions and WebKit’s FormatConverter pack RA8
from the red and alpha channels the same way.
